# E71-04: this directory is Jazzer JUnit's documented "inputs directory" for
# DomainDecoderFuzzTest#fuzzTargetDomainDecoder (github.com/CodeIntelligenceTesting/jazzer README
# "Inputs directory") — it must exist so crash reproducers land here deterministically rather than
# wherever the test happened to run from, but the crash files themselves are ephemeral CI/local
# artifacts, not committed regression fixtures. tools/fuzz/jazzer/smoke.sh copies a crash out to
# its own --artifact-dir and deletes it from here afterwards; this ignore rule is a second layer
# of protection against ever committing one by accident.
*
!.gitignore
